| [`tutorials/tutorial_two_cell_types.ipynb`](tutorials/tutorial_two_cell_types.ipynb) | Mouse brain MERFISH (Zhang et al. *Nature* 2023) | Cross-type co-progression between D1 and D2 striatal neurons |

